        "To shield individual directors from catastrophic monetary liability, Tier 1 audits the corporate charter under DGCL \u00a7 102(b)(7). Following recent statutory amendments, this charter exculpation clause extends to both directors and senior corporate officers, completely eliminating monetary liability for breaches of the Duty of Care. However, because exculpation cannot reach bad faith or disloyalty, the control tower implements a continuous monitoring framework complying with In re Walt Disney Co. and Stone v. Ritter.",
